    "title": "Who is the Artemis III astronaut who survived one of spaceflight's most dangerous accidents? - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Rakshanda Noor Khan ,\n1 hours ago NASA has announced the four astronauts who will fly on the Artemis III mission on June 9, 2026, at Johnson Space Center in Houston. The crew includes NASA astronaut Randy Bresnik as commander, European Space Agency (ESA) astronaut Luca Parmitano as pilot, and NASA astronauts Frank Rubio and Andre Douglas as mission specialists. Read full article",
